{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-world-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "title": "《太虚遗录》",
    "summary": "山门将闭，一盏没有点燃的灯，把七个各自背负疑问的身份引向玄霄宗不肯承认的旧事。",
    "authoringSource": "source_text_script",
    "contentRating": "unspecified",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "chapterHeadingStyle": "chinese_chapter",
    "visualPrompt": "古典修仙，雨夜玄霄宗山门、青石封山线、无火引路灯与青白灵光，无现代物品。",
    "openingReviewSha256": "03b25ee7e650fed3b47ae1ddea7489b4177efd62db10b5756e3caae8b8e56d6e"
  },
  "world": {
    "premise": "雨从酉时开始下。；陆照临走完最后一百级石阶时，天已经黑透。",
    "immutableFacts": [
      {
        "id": "fact_40e04aa649d1",
        "text": "他走近了两步，却停在青石外。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-001",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 37,
          "end": 37
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_97df829d5ef5",
        "text": "第三缕终于停在胸口，像一粒不肯沉下去的石子。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-003",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 367,
          "end": 367
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_3d5273603ad7",
        "text": "若这只是阵法故障，便不该如此精准地避开所有人的眼睛。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-004",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 605,
          "end": 605
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_9da2cf9c9c8d",
        "text": "顾长离将一枚铜针夹在指间，目光停在石板缝隙。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-005",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 687,
          "end": 687
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_580b45501e8f",
        "text": "那不是阵法故障会说的话，也不是一盏没有灯芯的灯能留下的黑灰。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-008",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1208,
          "end": 1208
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_2af3bdd79b1a",
        "text": "顾长离的手指停在木牌背面。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-008",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1226,
          "end": 1226
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_ab09314ecb8d",
        "text": "沈砚秋走下高台，停在陆照临面前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-008",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1268,
          "end": 1268
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_3bd195da4c7b",
        "text": "她走到木架前，手指掠过封皮，最后停在第四卷的裁口。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-009",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1414,
          "end": 1414
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_a855a02313a2",
        "text": "三页吐纳诀他已经能够完整运转一周，灵气停在气海，仍只比入门时多了一线。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-010",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1548,
          "end": 1548
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_1f2129d6abaa",
        "text": "小灯没有火，却逆流向上，停在桥墩旁。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-011",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1821,
          "end": 1821
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_5bd4f5e794fb",
        "text": "老妇的手停在半空。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-012",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1913,
          "end": 1913
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_a89023cd713e",
        "text": "声音从客舍门前向镇外延伸，最终停在石碑旁。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-012",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2055,
          "end": 2055
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_657fdd6720c8",
        "text": "还有一行，直接停在客舍门前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-012",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2065,
          "end": 2065
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_80f9f61ab2fa",
        "text": "陆照临听见自己的呼吸，也听见门外那行脚印停在了门槛前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-012",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2092,
          "end": 2092
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_e7da22301775",
        "text": "它停在门槛前，像一个守规矩的客人，等屋里的人先开口。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-013",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2118,
          "end": 2118
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_fb116436da35",
        "text": "镇民家门紧闭，门缝里塞着灰泥，有些门板上画着半盏灯，有些则把灯纹全部刮掉。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-013",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2156,
          "end": 2156
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_c03db1336997",
        "text": "路线图从玄霄宗开始，途经旧驿道，最后停在一处被黑墨涂掉的地点。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-013",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2162,
          "end": 2162
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_11ea2c6834a6",
        "text": "有人踩过街上的积水，停在旧屋前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-013",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2176,
          "end": 2176
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_8a32a27443a1",
        "text": "四周屋舍紧闭，墙缝里的青光却像水一样向这里汇聚。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-014",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2300,
          "end": 2300
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_b2611dfd83f4",
        "text": "它停在门槛外，没有立即进来，像在等待第二盏灯的回应。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-014",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2412,
          "end": 2412
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_fd41427fe8aa",
        "text": "镇北所有仓房的门同时震动，墙缝里的青光开始向屋内倒灌。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-014",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2420,
          "end": 2420
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_7bc5f0668aca",
        "text": "黑衣人停在桥头。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-015",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_079",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2622,
          "end": 2622
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_57038c960a00",
        "text": "黑衣人没有追，他们停在门外，像是知道门内的规则不允许更多人同行。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-016",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_083",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2697,
          "end": 2697
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_e76aa44232a1",
        "text": "陆照临看向紧闭的石楼。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-016",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_084",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2725,
          "end": 2725
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_c929d7962fc1",
        "text": "楼门紧闭，门上却嵌着一枚顾氏旧印。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-017",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_086",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2938,
          "end": 2938
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_48d63fb38071",
        "text": "她站在城心石阶下，背影被青灯拉得很长，脚边散着几枚断开的铜针。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-017",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3049,
          "end": 3049
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_1e0334e80eda",
        "text": "陆照临掌心的残印沿着地面白光移动，停在一枚裂开的石片前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-018",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_095",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3111,
          "end": 3111
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_4cbc89056319",
        "text": "镜中出现三条未来：第一条，第二盏灯进入城心，城中无脸人恢复面目；第二条，残印被毁，灵脉倒灌，整座城塌陷；第三条，灯被带离，城心封闭，但所有失去名字的人永远无法回来。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-019",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_104",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3411,
          "end": 3411
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_3fc5cb1b3d02",
        "text": "脚印停在黑铁门前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-020",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_107",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3529,
          "end": 3529
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_39ff52b3bd5c",
        "text": "人影停在旧驿道尽头，灯杆上的第三盏灯仍未点燃。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-021",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_116",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3777,
          "end": 3777
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_88a4394ba9c8",
        "text": "那一缕灵气不再散开，稳稳停在气海中央，像一粒冰珠。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-022",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_117",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3925,
          "end": 3925
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_9caaa55217df",
        "text": "沈砚秋坐在灯下，手指停在纸面。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-024",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_127",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4239,
          "end": 4239
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_e8b91fc21459",
        "text": "叶观澜停在一块黑色岩石旁。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-025",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_134",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4459,
          "end": 4459
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_49f4991026af",
        "text": "雪花停在半空，玄霄宗弟子的剑停在半途，顾长离伸出的手也停在距离他半尺的位置。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-025",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_138",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4581,
          "end": 4581
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_0438092ac604",
        "text": "它越过雪坡，越过营地，最后停在陆照临面前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-025",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_138",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4585,
          "end": 4585
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_3ce6cdfd747f",
        "text": "裂缝沿钟楼向下，穿过城心，最终停在封天令的空白处。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-030",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_170",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5621,
          "end": 5621
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_f4bcbf7ab954",
        "text": "街边飘落的雪花悬在半空，火盆里的灰烬凝成灰白色的线，连陆照临眼角滑下的泪也停在半途。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-031",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_171",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5659,
          "end": 5659
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_8c71c6ee7aa8",
        "text": "灵气倒灌却越来越强，黑色弧线表面迅速结霜。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-031",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_172",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5705,
          "end": 5705
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_fe2bb74f1cf9",
        "text": "”守门长老说，“若不封门，灵脉会继续倒灌。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-033",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_187",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6072,
          "end": 6072
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_5a563a8d1ff7",
        "text": "影子走进议事殿，停在黑漆木盒前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-033",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_192",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6142,
          "end": 6142
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_ead2242872fb",
        "text": "归墟盟主停在城门外，回头看了一眼。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-034",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_212",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6458,
          "end": 6458
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_a9761675c134",
        "text": "图上每一处改动都标着日期，最后一笔停在他离开北河城的那天。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-035",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_220",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6686,
          "end": 6686
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_3ed00a71f9d7",
        "text": "刀锋停在纸面一寸外，被无形力量弹回。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-038",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_243",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7260,
          "end": 7260
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_85343dbe25d4",
        "text": "河水倒灌进村庄，刚学会引气的孩子在睡梦中被灵流灼伤，山脚的凡人集市起火，玄霄宗与归墟盟的旧阵同时失控。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-041",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_262",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7630,
          "end": 7630
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_a9451e81adb7",
        "text": "沈砚秋翻开记录册，册页自行翻动，最后停在一张从未写过字的空白页上。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-041",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_268",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7752,
          "end": 7752
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_46433df83a5d",
        "text": "街道两旁立着低矮的木楼，门窗紧闭，屋檐下悬着一串串木牌。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-043",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_275",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7950,
          "end": 7950
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_2f0a2d2bac3e",
        "text": "陆照临停在黑色竹简前。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-043",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_278",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8064,
          "end": 8064
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_64a3e73e880d",
        "text": "石阶两侧点着青灯，灯火里没有火苗，只有一张张紧闭的嘴。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-044",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_282",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8124,
          "end": 8124
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_32f588427415",
        "text": "陆照临体内的空白停在颈下。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-044",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_289",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8284,
          "end": 8284
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_3465c4782f4d",
        "text": "他试着回忆父亲修灯的最后一个手势，指尖却只停在半空。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-047",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_312",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8476,
          "end": 8476
        }
      }
    ],
